    "hotelDescription": "So close to the sights you\u0027re almost rubbing shoulders with Royalty, Premier Inn London Victoria puts you in prime position. You can stroll to many of the capital\u0027s most famous sights and, with Victoria Station just minutes away, you\u0027re connected to city, country and coast. \n\nCatch the changing of the guard at Buckingham Palace, get arty at the Tate, cruise along the Thames, be wowed by a West End show, then return to the peace and quiet of Pimlico. Here you\u0027ll find everything you need to recharge the batteries: spacious rooms, a tasty restaurant, and extra-comfy beds.",
    "hotelSPFDescription": "",
    "hotelDirections": "From Victoria train station: take the exit onto Wilton Road at the far right side of the station opposite platforms 1 to 7 (directly opposite Apollo Theatre). Turn right and keep to the right hand pavement. Continue past Bridge Place and turn right onto Gillingham Street. Continue along this road until just before you reach a set of traffic lights, where you will find our hotel on your left. From Victoria coach station: exit left onto Buckingham Palace Road and take the second right onto Belgrave Road. Take the second left onto Gillingham St and the hotel will be on the right hand side.",
